--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHY APACHE-2.0 AND NOT MIT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

We have not completed a patent search, and a known commercial vendor in this space
states publicly that it holds granted patents on model scanning. For a project with
unresolved patent exposure in its own risk register, Apache-2.0's express patent grant
and defensive-termination clause (Section 3) are load-bearing where MIT's silence is
not. The choice is recorded here so it reads as a decision rather than a default.

