discipline around them, and naming the antecedents is part of that discipline.

  Trigger reversal
    Neural Cleanse (Wang et al., IEEE S&P 2019) and descendants.

  Cross-precision differential testing
    DiffChaser (Xie, Ma, Chen et al., IJCAI 2019)
    DiverGet (arXiv:2207.06282, EMSE 2022)
